 "text": "Before you pick a time below, give me two minutes.\n\nBecause the problem you just booked this call about is not the one most immigration firms think they have.\n\nIt isn't leads. It's who's on the other end of them.\n\nImmigration firms are flooded with low-quality leads. People who take the consult, take the advice, and never hire you.\n\nSo we spent years fixing exactly that, using the latest AI qualification technology,\n\nand we implement it, refine it, and re-implement it every single day across twenty-three different law firms.\n\nAlmost every firm we partner with starts in one of two places.\n\nEither they can't grow, because they only rely on referrals,\n\nor the ads work, the leads come in, and the wrong people fill the calendar.\n\nHere's what changes. Over ninety days, we build three things inside your firm.\n\nOne: ad campaigns that bring in people who already know what hiring an attorney costs.\n\nTwo: an AI qualification funnel that screens every lead before anyone touches your calendar. Budget, location, case type, and a commitment to a time.\n\nThree: automated intake inside your own CRM, so every lead is answered, tracked, and followed up.\n\nAll you have to do is take the consult that's already on your calendar.\n\nAnd you own all of it. Your accounts, your website, your data. No monthly retainers. No rip-and-replace.\n\nNow, the call you're about to book. It's a ten-minute phone call to get to know you and your firm a little better.\n\nIt is not a sales call. Ten minutes isn't enough to sell anything.\n\nWe have to determine two things first: whether we can actually help you, and whether your firm qualifies to work with us.\n\nIf both are a yes, we book a thirty-minute video call, whenever we're both free, and walk you through everything in detail.\n\nAnd the guarantee: if you're not profitable after ninety days, you get every dollar back. No questions.\n\nPick your time below.",
